- 1 Generate an 𝑐𝑒𝑖𝑙( 𝑥 ′′ 𝑟 𝜏 ′′ ) × 𝑐𝑒𝑖𝑙( 𝑦 ′′ 𝑟 𝜏 ′′ ) PSF matrix 𝐼𝑥 𝐼𝑥 ′′ 𝑦 ′′ ;
- 2 Generate an 𝑐𝑒𝑖𝑙( 𝑥 ′′ 𝑟 𝜏 ′′ ) × 𝑐𝑒𝑖𝑙( 𝑦 ′′ 𝑟 𝜏 ′′ ) complex amplitude matrix e E x ′′ y ′′ ;
- 3 Compute the intersection (𝑥 ′′ 𝑐 , 𝑦 ′′ 𝑐 , 𝑧 ′′ ) of the main ray and the image plane by raytracing;
to acquire the imaging center (𝑥 ′′ 𝑐 , 𝑦 ′′ 𝑐 , 𝑧 ′′ 𝑐 ) on the image plane and then perform the optical PSF calculation within the sampling range 𝑥 ′′ 𝑟 × 𝑦 ′′ 𝑟 .
